cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Datum in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Datum: Retrieval as a Compiled Query for Agentic Systems"
abstract: >-
  Datum is a retrieval substrate for AI agents. It compiles every query into an
  explainable, replayable physical plan over one versioned, content-addressed
  store, so identity, cost, trust, and evidence sufficiency are part of the
  request rather than smuggled through a metadata filter.
type: software
